### Variables (remplacer le token par un jeton Keycloak valide)
@host = http://localhost:8086
@token = COLLER_LE_TOKEN_ICI

### Créer un voyage
POST {{host}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Week-end à Tabarka",
  "description": "Escapade en bord de mer",
  "startDate": "2026-12-10",
  "endDate": "2026-12-13",
  "status": "PLANNED"
}

### Lister mes voyages
GET {{host}}/api/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Détail d'un voyage (avec étapes)
GET {{host}}/api/trips/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modifier un voyage
PUT {{host}}/api/trips/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Week-end à Tabarka (modifié)",
  "description": "Escapade en bord de mer",
  "startDate": "2026-12-10",
  "endDate": "2026-12-14",
  "status": "PLANNED"
}

### Supprimer un voyage
DELETE {{host}}/api/trips/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ajouter une étape
POST {{host}}/api/trips/1/stops
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityName": "Tabarka",
  "country": "Tunisie",
  "arrivalDate": "2026-12-10",
  "departureDate": "2026-12-12"
}

### Lister les étapes
GET {{host}}/api/trips/1/stops
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Détail d'une étape
GET {{host}}/api/trips/1/stops/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modifier une étape
PUT {{host}}/api/trips/1/stops/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityName": "Tabarka",
  "country": "Tunisie",
  "arrivalDate": "2026-12-10",
  "departureDate": "2026-12-13"
}

### Supprimer une étape
DELETE {{host}}/api/trips/1/stops/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Résumé météo + niveau de risque par étape
GET {{host}}/api/trips/1/weather
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recommandations par étape
GET {{host}}/api/trips/1/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
